    "Maps and course search use Apple services and may require an internet connection. Requests to those services are governed by Apple's privacy policy. SwingLab does not add advertising or analytics SDKs.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maps and course search use Apple services and may require an internet connection. Requests to those services are governed by Apple's privacy policy. SwingLab does not add advertising or analytics SDKs."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "지도와 코스 검색은 Apple 서비스를 사용하며 인터넷 연결이 필요할 수 있습니다. 해당 요청에는 Apple 개인정보 처리방침이 적용됩니다. SwingLab은 광고나 분석 SDK를 추가하지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "地図とコース検索はAppleのサービスを利用し、インターネット接続が必要な場合があります。サービスへのリクエストにはAppleのプライバシーポリシーが適用されます。SwingLabは広告・分析SDKを追加していません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "地图和球场搜索使用 Apple 服务，可能需要联网。这些服务请求适用 Apple 隐私政策。SwingLab 不添加广告或分析 SDK。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "地圖和球場搜尋使用 Apple 服務，可能需要連線。這些服務請求適用 Apple 隱私權政策。SwingLab 不加入廣告或分析 SDK。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los mapas y la búsqueda usan servicios de Apple y pueden necesitar internet. Estas solicitudes se rigen por la política de privacidad de Apple. SwingLab no añade SDK de publicidad o analítica."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mapas e busca usam serviços Apple e podem precisar de internet. As solicitações seguem a política de privacidade da Apple. SwingLab não adiciona SDKs de anúncios ou análise."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Karten und Platzsuche nutzen Apple-Dienste und können Internet benötigen. Anfragen unterliegen Apples Datenschutzrichtlinie. SwingLab fügt keine Werbe- oder Analyse-SDKs hinzu."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les cartes et recherches utilisent les services Apple et peuvent nécessiter internet. Les requêtes relèvent de la politique de confidentialité d’Apple. SwingLab n’ajoute aucun SDK publicitaire ou analytique."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mappe e ricerca campi usano servizi Apple e possono richiedere internet. Le richieste seguono l’informativa sulla privacy di Apple. SwingLab non aggiunge SDK pubblicitari o di analisi."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "แผนที่และการค้นหาสนามใช้บริการ Apple และอาจต้องเชื่อมต่ออินเทอร์เน็ต คำขออยู่ภายใต้นโยบายความเป็นส่วนตัวของ Apple SwingLab ไม่เพิ่ม SDK โฆษณาหรือวิเคราะห์"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bản đồ và tìm sân dùng dịch vụ Apple, có thể cần internet. Yêu cầu tuân theo chính sách quyền riêng tư Apple. SwingLab không thêm SDK quảng cáo hay phân tích."
          }
        }
      }
    },
