    "The record was removed, but its video could not be erased. Use Delete All Local Data in Settings to retry.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The record was removed, but its video could not be erased. Use Delete All Local Data in Settings to retry."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "기록은 삭제했지만 영상 파일은 지우지 못했습니다. 설정의 모든 로컬 데이터 삭제로 다시 시도하세요."
